<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Locked &amp; Loaded (Official Fortnite Anthem)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">d4vd</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Locked &amp; Loaded (Official Fortnite Anthem)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4ipGjejGLalq6rCtK7Mmom</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.282" end="00:11.682">Do you get scared?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.682" end="00:13.950">Do you feel lost?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.950" end="00:16.299">I can smell fear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.299" end="00:18.632">I been there before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.632" end="00:21.115">But you made it through the storm again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.115" end="00:23.332">You did it on your own again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.332" end="00:25.790">Goosebumps on your skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.790" end="00:28.002">Do you feel what I feel?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.002" end="00:30.550">I'm waiting on you to notice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.550" end="00:32.950">That you got what you wanted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.950" end="00:35.251">We don't got time to cry right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.251" end="00:39.544">Only got time to focus</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.544" end="00:41.960">Two hits on a waitlist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.960" end="00:44.344">I was armed and dangerous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.344" end="00:46.694">Take a shot, leave them faceless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.694" end="00:49.182">I was armed and dangerous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.182" end="00:51.550">On a whole different level</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.550" end="00:53.966">I can see why they hating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.966" end="00:56.332">I was armed and dangerous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.332" end="00:57.909">I was armed and dangerous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.909" end="01:02.494">You should've noticed I've been focused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.494" end="01:07.458">You should've known I'm locked and loaded</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.458" end="01:12.155">You should've noticed I've been focused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.155" end="01:16.376">You should've known I'm locked and loaded</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.376" end="01:18.833">Better watch your back 'cause we aimin' at your head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.833" end="01:21.254">I don't need a pick me up, and I don't need a res</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.254" end="01:23.595">Knock down, top down, hit him in his leg</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.595" end="01:26.044">Pulled up with the trio and my eyes all red</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.044" end="01:28.510">One, two, three of us, can't compete with us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.510" end="01:31.324">Everybody screaming like they didn't believe in us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.324" end="01:37.076">Believe in us, believe in us, believe in us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.076" end="01:39.479">Two hits on a waitlist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.479" end="01:41.912">I was armed and dangerous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.912" end="01:44.335">Take a shot, leave them faceless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.335" end="01:46.636">I was armed and dangerous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.636" end="01:49.102">On a whole different level</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.102" end="01:51.503">I can see why they hating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.503" end="01:53.895">I was armed and dangerous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.895" end="01:55.556">I was armed and dangerous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.556" end="02:00.157">You should've noticed I've been focused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.157" end="02:05.056">You should've known I'm locked and loaded</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.056" end="02:09.674">You should've noticed I've been focused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.674" end="02:13.674">You should've known I'm locked and loaded</p></div></body></tt>